SUMMARY:IMPROMPTU: 65 miles (H) BOLC from Gap
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide Leader: Lynn Pfeil\n
 \nThis is a training ride for a few of us participating in America's Most 
 Beautiful Bike Ride for Blood Cancer United\, in Lake Tahoe on June 7th bu
 t **ALL ARE WELCOME**! Our pace will probably be about 13 but you can ride
  FASTER! This is a revision of a "Best of Lancaster County" ride. This bea
 utiful ride is similar to last week's at the start\, taking us to Octorara
  Creek/Wolf's Hollow Park\, for some terrific climbing! Most of the climbi
 ng is up front. There will be plenty of rest stop options along the way!\n
 Route:\nhttps://ridewithgps.com/routes/54870882\n\nInterested in **donatin
 g to Blood Cancer United** (formerly the Leukemia and Lymphoma Society)? h
 ttp://tinyurl.com/tahoe26\n\nInterested in **joining us in Lake Tahoe**? [
 https://pages.lls.org/events/home/ambbr2026#register-section](https://page
 s.lls.org/events/home/ambbr2026#register-section)\n\nHelmets are mandatory
 . No ear buds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tir
 e levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and pape
 r waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join th
 is ride.\nBeing on Meetup does not mean you are a club member. [Join here]
 (https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)
 .\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's [Code of Conduct](ht
 tps://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&
 module_id=323984) \,\n[Rules of the Road](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress
 .com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159) \, and [Ride
  Waiver](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=454318)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3145535
 72/
