 ub_id=257148) the club.\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the clu
 b's [Code of Conduct](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?pa
 ge_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984) and [Rules of the Road](https://
 lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module
