SUMMARY:Casual Ride (D) - GS Bird in Hand Sticky Bun Ride (24F)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide leader: open\nAntici
 pated Average Pace for D rides: (12-14 mph)\nRoute: [Bird in Hand Sticky B
 un Ride](https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/gs-bird-in-hand-sticky-b
 un-ride-24f/)\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, and Ride Together**\n\nThis is a Cas
 ual D Class ride. The ride leader will ride at the advertised average spee
 d. This is intended to be a group ride with a no-drop rule as the main goa
 l. The ride leader will do his/her best to keep the group together with oc
 casional regroupings and/or splitting into multiple groups to align to pac
 e capabilities.\n\nPlease do not join this ride if you are not willing to 
 ride with the group. If you exceed the posted pace\, you will be riding by
  yourself and encouraged to join a faster group. If maintaining a 12-14 mp
 h average is beyond your current ability level\, please consider joining a
  slower ride first.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring wat
 er and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\
 n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Clu
 b membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Being on Meetup does
  not mean you are a club member. Join here [Member Signup](https://www.lan
 casterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\n\nYour RSVP is
  your agreement to abide by the club's Code of Conduct: [Code of Conduct](
 https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&m
 odule_id=323984)\n\nGuidance if an incident occurs: [Incident Actions](htt
 ps://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_i
 d=326137)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3144766
 17/
